cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SEMbada in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SEMbada: Portable PLS-SEM software"
abstract: "SEMbada estimates partial least squares structural equation models (PLS-SEM and consistent PLS) with bootstrapping, PLSpredict, mediation, moderation, higher-order constructs, multigroup analysis with MICOM, and importance-performance map analysis. It runs offline as a single HTML file and exports Word reports, conference-style papers (Word, LaTeX, PDF), PowerPoint and Beamer slides, Excel tables, and figures."
version: 1.11.4
date-released: "2026-11-19"
authors:
  - family-names: Suhermi
    given-names: Novri
    affiliation: "Institut Teknologi Sepuluh Nopember, Surabaya, Indonesia"
repository-code: "https://github.com/novrisuhermi/sembada"
url: "https://novrisuhermi-sem.share.connect.posit.cloud"
keywords:
  - PLS-SEM
  - partial least squares
  - structural equation modeling
  - consistent PLS
  - bootstrapping
  - PLSpredict
  - multigroup analysis
  - importance-performance map analysis
